          "text": "Estabizz reduces avoidable delay by preparing a trademark-assignment-ready file: trademark status report, owner verification, portfolio schedule, assignment structure note, deed checklist, stamp-duty checklist, corporate authorisation, Form TM-P data sheet, certified deed copy, statement of case, Registry-query tracker and post-recordal update tracker."
